# PROJ-2 · Ignored files copied into a worktree: :copy and .worktreeinclude.
start
see any key: close
key Escape
type :copy .env
key Enter
see .env is copied into shelf's worktrees
type :copy
key Enter
see copied into shelf's worktrees: .env
key /
type mend shelf.py
key Enter
key Escape Escape
see run .imece/worktree-setup.sh
# The journal as it is (the story folds lines of a kind).
key J
key J
see copied .env into claude-1's worktree
see copied local.cfg into claude-1's worktree
sh test -f state/imece/worktrees/*/claude-1/.env && test ! -L state/imece/worktrees/*/claude-1/.env
